<section class="content-section" id="overview-section">
    <div class="content-container">
        <div class="text-content">
            <h2 class="section-title">DSC in Delhi: Class 3 for MCA, GST, DGFT, and Delhi Tenders</h2>
            <div class="content-text">
                <div class="highlight-box" style="margin-bottom:20px;">
                    <p><strong>&#128204; TL;DR - DSC in Delhi Services at a Glance</strong></p>
                    <p>DSC = legally valid electronic signature under IT Act 2000 S.35. Only Class 3 since Jan 2021. Mandatory for MCA21/RoC Delhi, GST, ITR, DGFT, and all Delhi govt procurement (DDA/PWD/NDMC/DMRC). Combo (Sign+Encrypt) for tenders. DGFT DSC linked to IEC. Same day via Aadhaar eKYC. From Rs 849/year. FIPS 140-3 USB token (CCA March 2023). Patron Rohini = walk-in same day.</p>
                </div>
                <p>Delhi generates one of India's highest DSC demands. For a comprehensive overview, see our <a href="#">Digital Signature Certificate</a> national guide.</p><div class="table-responsive-wrapper"><table><thead><tr><th>Parameter</th><th>Detail</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Governing Law</td><td>IT Act 2000 - Sections 3, 5, 35. CCA-licensed Certifying Authorities</td></tr><tr><td>Class</td><td>Only Class 3 since Jan 2021 (Class 1 & 2 discontinued). Highest identity assurance</td></tr><tr><td>Cost</td><td>Individual Rs 849/yr | Combo Rs 2,000-3,500 | DGFT Rs 2,600 with token</td></tr><tr><td>Timeline</td><td>Aadhaar eKYC: same day (minutes) | Manual KYC: 1-2 days | DGFT: +1 day IEC check</td></tr><tr><td>Delhi Portals</td><td>MCA21, GST, DGFT, govtprocurement.delhi.gov.in (DDA/PWD/NDMC/DMRC), GeM, ICEGATE</td></tr></tbody></table></div><p</p>
                <p>CP trade houses + Nehru Place IT + Okhla exporters + Aerocity logistics + Rohini SMEs. RoC Delhi (Shastri Bhavan) directors need Class 3 for MCA21. DGFT Delhi (Udyog Bhavan) exporters need DGFT Combo. DDA/PWD/NDMC/DMRC contractors need Combo for govtprocurement.delhi.gov.in (4,700+ active tenders). GeM requires Combo. CAs need Professional DSC. Without DSC = locked out of compliance + tenders. Patron Rohini = same-day walk-in eKYC.</p>
                <p>Content is reviewed quarterly for accuracy.</p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

<!-- SECTION 3: WHAT IS GSTAT APPEAL FILING -->
<section class="content-section" id="what-section">
    <div class="content-container">
        <div class="two-column">
            <div class="column-content">
                <h2 class="section-title">What Is a Digital Signature Certificate?</h2>
                <div class="content-text what-is-definition">
                    
                    <p><strong>Definition:</strong> Electronic credential issued under IT Act 2000 S.35 by CCA-licensed Certifying Authority. Authenticates identity + ensures document integrity via PKI cryptography (private key on FIPS USB token + public key verifiable).</p><p><strong>Legal effect:</strong> Under S.5 IT Act, DSC = same legal weight as wet-ink signature. Tamper-proof + non-repudiable under Indian Evidence Act 1872.</p><p><strong>Delhi requirement:</strong> Every MCA21 form (SPICe+ to MGT-7/AOC-4) must carry Class 3 DSC. DGFT portal requires IEC-linked DSC. Delhi eProcurement requires Combo.</p>

                </div>
                <div class="highlight-box" style="margin-top:20px;">
                    <p><strong>Key Terms for DSC in Delhi:</strong></p>
                    <p><strong>Class 3 DSC:</strong> Only active class since Jan 2021 (Class 1 & 2 discontinued by CCA). Highest identity assurance via video or Aadhaar eKYC.</p><p><strong>Combo DSC:</strong> Signing + Encryption. Mandatory for govtprocurement.delhi.gov.in (DDA/PWD/NDMC/DMRC) and GeM bidding.</p><p><strong>DGFT DSC:</strong> Class 3 linked to entity's IEC for DGFT portal. EPCG, Advance Auth, IEC modification. For Okhla/CP exporters.</p><p><strong>FIPS 140-3 Token:</strong> CCA March 2023 mandate. Older tokens incompatible. New FIPS token Rs 500-1,200.</p><p><strong>CCA:</strong> Controller of Certifying Authorities (MeitY). Licenses CAs: eMudhra, Capricorn, Vsign, Sify, (n)Code, XtraTrust.</p>

                </div>
            </div>
